                                                "sense_id": "958f4757-047b-3e40-8daa-432ea716ff43",
                                                "text": "Do you know whether any country offices pay their men by the thousand, or whether they are on stab wages? — I do not know. Some are paid stab wages, but I do not know whether there is much piece-work."
                                            },
